{
  "$comment": "Rules for scripts/build-cube-recipes.mjs. 'rules' are matched in order against cubemain.txt 'description' (case-insensitive regex); the first match wins. 'title'/'group' may use $1..$n from the match. Rows matching no rule land in 'Other Recipes' and are listed in the build report.",
  "pageNotes": [
    "Most, but not all, recipes that reroll the input don't work if the input has a Forging. If you find a recipe doesn't work, please check if the input has a Forging or not.",
    "You can buy Stockers at Gheed. Most Stockers can store up to 2 items of a kind at once.",
    "Torso means Body Armor. Armor means all kinds of armor."
  ],
  "categories": [
    {
      "id": "special",
      "title": "Special"
    },
    {
      "id": "uber",
      "title": "Uber / Endgame Map Recipes"
    },
    {
      "id": "legendary",
      "title": "Legendary Consumables",
      "intro": "Legendary consumables are extremely rare consumables that can be used only once and the outcome cannot be reverted. They grant special bonuses."
    },
    {
      "id": "mastery",
      "title": "Weapon Mastery"
    },
    {
      "id": "anoint",
      "title": "Anointments",
      "intro": "Anointing rolls one random Anointment for the item type."
    },
    {
      "id": "corrupt",
      "title": "Corruptions",
      "intro": "Corrupting rolls one random outcome for the item type and quality."
    },
    {
      "id": "sanct",
      "title": "Sanctification"
    },
    {
      "id": "mis",
      "title": "Misc / Repair"
    },
    {
